Paalis na kami.

34:47.041 --> 34:48.125
Ganap.

34:48.250 --> 34:49.250
Huminga tayo, Bri-Bri.

34:49.375 --> 34:50.458
Wag mo na akong tawaging Bri-Bri, okay?

34:50.583 --> 34:51.458
Hindi tayo magkaibigan.

34:51.583 --> 34:52.958
Wow.

34:53.083 --> 34:54.791
