At nagmaneho ako ng 200 milya
para takasan sila.

35:31.750 --> 35:33.000
Ugh.

35:35.166 --> 35:36.250
Okay.

35:36.375 --> 35:37.833
[kakatwang musika]

35:41.708 --> 35:43.000
Teka.

35:43.125 --> 35:44.708
