kung paano ako nakapasa,

36:16.875 --> 36:20.750
'cause there's like literally
no chance na nakapasa ako.

36:20.875 --> 36:23.166
Anyway, kaya noong ginagawa ko
itong top secret building,

36:23.291 --> 36:24.583
ang tanging ibang empleyado
na nakita ko doon

36:24.708 --> 36:25.666
may balbas ba itong dude

36:25.791 --> 36:28.333
