59:04.583 --> 59:06.125
Wow, ang galing ng lalaking ito.

59:08.708 --> 59:11.208
Oh tao, sobrang galing.

59:11.333 --> 59:12.375
Mm, mm, mm!

59:12.500 --> 59:13.958
Ipasok ang laban na iyan.
Mm, mm, mm!

59:14.083 --> 59:16.291
Oof. Okay.
Super creepy din.

59:17.583 --> 59:18.958
♪ Labing-apat na dolyar
